\f1  NetFullSysInfo.widget\
\
A minimal yet powerful \'dcbersicht widget that displays live system info and network status with a clean macOS aesthetic.\
\

\f0 \uc0\u55358 \u56785 \u8205 \u55357 \u56507 
\f1  Developed by James Southcombe\
