\
## 
\f0 \uc0\u55358 \u56816 
\f1  Features\
\
- 
\f0 \uc0\u55357 \u56960 
\f1  System Hostname, Uptime, Live CPU, Memory, Disk, Ping time to 8.8.8.8 and Battery percentage & charging status.\
- 
\f0 \uc0\u55356 \u57104 
\f1  Displays Network connectivity including IP/MAC for all active network interfaces.\
- 
\f0 \uc0\u9881 \u65039 	
\f1 Displays current macOS version number.\
-  
\f2 \cf2 \uc0\u55357 \u56716 \u65039 
\f1 \cf0 Styled to match macOS design.\
- 
\f0 \uc0\u55357 \u56741 
\f1  Works seamlessly with \'dcbersicht.\
