## 
\f0 \uc0\u55358 \u56813 
\f1  Installation Instructions\
\
1. **Install [\'dcbersicht](http://tracesof.net/uebersicht/) if you haven\'92t already.**\
\
2. **Move the `NetFullSysInfo.widget` folder into your \'dcbersicht widgets folder:**\
\
3. **If the Widget doesn\'92t appear to be working as intended then follow the below steps:**\
\
	1. Open Terminal \
\
	2. Navigate to your widget directory (Click \'dcbersicht in the menu bar>Click Open Widgets Folder)\
\
	3. Replace this path with correct path for your widgets location and paste into the Terminal shell and click Return\\Enter\
	cd ~/Library/Application\\ Support/\'dcbersicht/widgets/NetFullSysInfo.widget\
\
	4. Run this command to make the file executable: \
	chmod +x NetFullSysInfo.sh\
\
	5. While Terminal is still pointing at the Widgets folder run the following:\
	xattr -d com.apple.quarantine NetFullSysInfo.sh\
\
	6. Restart \'dcbersicht and the Widget should now pull all the relevant information and appear on your desktop. \
\
You can also copy and paste this entire block into Terminal and hit Enter/Return (you will still need to ensure you replace paths for your widget location): \
cd ~/Library/Application\\ Support/\'dcbersicht/widgets/NetFullSysInfo.widget && \\\
chmod +x NetFullSysInfo.sh && \\\
xattr -d com.apple.quarantine NetFullSysInfo.sh\
\
